                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Its okay, but Im giving a positive review solely because it's the best and probably the only modern populous game so if you want to play that theres a good reason to try this out. \n\nI think there was a multiplayer aspect but it's gone now but still functional, its basically like creeper world with randomly generated levels and a campaign. Main negative about the game is it gets boring fast, you're just raising land while griefing the ai with powers. The ai is dumb and never seems to improve, the only challenge is when theres multiple opponents because they only use their powers on you which seems a little unfair. There's also no music, only a boring ambience which is a shame cause I liked the music from the flash version.",
